{"id": "33948", "title": "情染今生(幻镜下)", "author": "艾佟", "category": "文学名著", "count": 53, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/33/33948.htm", "intro": "这个女人怎么这么阴魂不散阿？！不管走到哪里都遇得见她，先是看到她和男人纠缠不清，后又被迫假装是她男友赶苍蝇，现在还登门入室跑来他家洗手作羹汤，以为生得一副娇柔模样他就会怜香惜玉？哼！绅士风度打从娘胎就不存在啦！何况她开口闭口就是那劳什子前世今生，他脑袋有问题才会和她一起“起肖”，不过为了应付老爸安排的无聊相亲宴，请她礼尚往来的客串女友一职不为过吧，可没想到她还真是“演技派”，竟让他入戏得认为有她在身边很幸福，这下糟了！自己没考虑要假戏真做呀……", "base": "files/article/html/33/33948", "chapters": [{"title": "第1页", "file": "2158334.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2158335.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2158336.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2158337.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2158338.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2158339.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2158340.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2158341.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2158342.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2158343.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2158344.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2158345.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2158346.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2158347.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2158348.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2158349.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2158350.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2158351.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2158352.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2158353.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2158354.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2158355.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2158356.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2158357.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第25页", "file": "215